  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-23" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%"&gt;6. The respondent had a net increase of $63.0 million in short-term borrowing during the quarter ended June 30, 2026 over the prior quarter. The respondent had $157.3 million of short-term debt as of June 30, 2026, consisting entirely of money pool borrowings. FERC authority granted in Docket No. ES25-11-000. Money pool authority granted in Illinois Commerce Commission Docket No. 14-0764.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
