        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The consolidated tax is allocated to each member of the consolidated tax group using a stand-alone calculation ratio to the total amount of tax owed by the consolidated group.</span>
